(2485877, 342966, 51386, '<td valign="top">Wow, where the hell did you find this room? I love the shadows here! Definitely a nice shot too. My taste goes a little bit grungier than this though (Just my opinion, but I would love to see this photo a little bit underexposed with contrast between the shadows and highlights. 8</td>', 'Wow, where the hell did you find this room? I love the shadows here! Definitely a nice shot too. My taste goes a little bit grungier than this though (Just my opinion, but I would love to see this photo a little bit underexposed with contrast between the shadows and highlights. 8', '2006-06-05 08:16:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2485878, 342679, 51386, '<td valign="top">Nice idea. The crop kinda bothers me though. I would like to see some more of the room. Maybe a corner or something? 7</td>', 'Nice idea. The crop kinda bothers me though. I would like to see some more of the room. Maybe a corner or something? 7', '2006-06-05 08:17:44.000000', NULL, 1),
