(2485984, 342075, 15711, '<td valign="top">This is the exact setting I was hoping to find for an entry.  But to no avail.  I love the variation in the wood slats on the floor, the single window and chair.  Really nice.  If I were to do anything, I might clone out the plug on the left wall, but that''s just a nitpick. Good job.</td>', 'This is the exact setting I was hoping to find for an entry.  But to no avail.  I love the variation in the wood slats on the floor, the single window and chair.  Really nice.  If I were to do anything, I might clone out the plug on the left wall, but that''s just a nitpick. Good job.', '2006-06-05 09:16:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2485987, 343212, 15711, '<td valign="top">Ok, this is SPECTACULAR. Love the high key effect.  Sherwin, is that you?  <br/> <br/>Great job - use of negative space just pulls your eye right to her.  Bravo 10</td>', 'Ok, this is SPECTACULAR. Love the high key effect.  Sherwin, is that you?   Great job - use of negative space just pulls your eye right to her.  Bravo 10', '2006-06-05 09:17:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2485988, 341886, 15711, '<td valign="top">Interesting concept.  I considered something like this but couldn''t carry it off. I like the light peeking through the crack in the door.  The single red of the dress makes for nice impact.</td>', 'Interesting concept.  I considered something like this but couldn''t carry it off. I like the light peeking through the crack in the door.  The single red of the dress makes for nice impact.', '2006-06-05 09:18:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2485991, 341325, 15711, '<td valign="top">Excellent.  The red really makes the shot.  Great back lighting.  The overall mood is emotive and a bit mysterious. Judi?  You did it again!! 9</td>', 'Excellent.  The red really makes the shot.  Great back lighting.  The overall mood is emotive and a bit mysterious. Judi?  You did it again!! 9', '2006-06-05 09:20:03.000000', NULL, 1),
