(2485996, 341832, 15711, '<td valign="top">WOW - outstanding.  The lighting is superb. Love the wrinkled up fabric on the floor - really makes for some added texture.  You have a winner here for sure. 10</td>', 'WOW - outstanding.  The lighting is superb. Love the wrinkled up fabric on the floor - really makes for some added texture.  You have a winner here for sure. 10', '2006-06-05 09:23:04.000000', NULL, 1),
