(2485999, 342017, 15711, '<td valign="top">Nice tilt. Works well. The muted tones add to the somber feel of the image. Love the hold in the ceiling. Good job.</td>', 'Nice tilt. Works well. The muted tones add to the somber feel of the image. Love the hold in the ceiling. Good job.', '2006-06-05 09:24:14.000000', NULL, 1),
