(2486757, 343238, 58906, '<td valign="top">Nice concept.  I like the job you did with the cord leading to the buffer.  I''m sure this was a challenging lighting situation, but you handled it admirably.</td>', 'Nice concept.  I like the job you did with the cord leading to the buffer.  I''m sure this was a challenging lighting situation, but you handled it admirably.', '2006-06-05 14:59:29.000000', NULL, 1),
