(2488624, 343047, 19831, '<td valign="top">Nice idea. The clouds look a little blown, but this looks like a tough exposure. Might be a little stronger compositionally if the person were framed a bit further away from the center of the shot.</td>', 'Nice idea. The clouds look a little blown, but this looks like a tough exposure. Might be a little stronger compositionally if the person were framed a bit further away from the center of the shot.', '2006-06-06 01:49:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2488669, 342608, 19831, '<td valign="top">Very cool shot. I like the processing, good job. Interesting lighting, creates interesting shadows. Just a great idea. Good choice of setting, and the pose of the subject. The old radiator heater adds some interest I think.  A very emotive image, the subjects pose, placement in the comp, and the rough wood plank floor, leading to her really drive the overall concept home. Not everyone can appreciate a good nude, but with a shot like this, I''m sure there will be plenty of folks that like it. I am digging it. Nice job.</td>', 'Very cool shot. I like the processing, good job. Interesting lighting, creates interesting shadows. Just a great idea. Good choice of setting, and the pose of the subject. The old radiator heater adds some interest I think.  A very emotive image, the subjects pose, placement in the comp, and the rough wood plank floor, leading to her really drive the overall concept home. Not everyone can appreciate a good nude, but with a shot like this, I''m sure there will be plenty of folks that like it. I am digging it. Nice job.', '2006-06-06 02:03:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2488688, 342903, 19831, '<td valign="top">Cool shot. Very chic looking. Great lighting. I like how you''ve gone with the pov from down low. I really like how the curtain is ''echoing'' the curves of the model. Cool idea. Nice job.</td>', 'Cool shot. Very chic looking. Great lighting. I like how you''ve gone with the pov from down low. I really like how the curtain is ''echoing'' the curves of the model. Cool idea. Nice job.', '2006-06-06 02:08:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2488700, 341366, 19831, '<td valign="top">This is a cool idea. Certainly a subject with good interest factor. I see what you''re doing with the point of view from down low, but I''m wondering if, given the subject, a shot from high looking down could work, maybe catch the snake in a nice ''S'' curve? It''s color sure makes him stand out well in the setting you''ve used. Nice job.</td>', 'This is a cool idea. Certainly a subject with good interest factor. I see what you''re doing with the point of view from down low, but I''m wondering if, given the subject, a shot from high looking down could work, maybe catch the snake in a nice ''S'' curve? It''s color sure makes him stand out well in the setting you''ve used. Nice job.', '2006-06-06 02:11:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2488891, 340273, 38835, '<td valign="top">kinda trite and not well done (not dark enough to portray the emotion properly)4</td>', 'kinda trite and not well done (not dark enough to portray the emotion properly)4', '2006-06-06 03:24:45.000000', NULL, 1),
