(2491275, 342828, 45003, '<td valign="top">Awesome. It makes me a little sad at the same time. I don''t know why. Perhaps because the girl looks unhappy. I like the negative space around the girl and the doll. Added to favorites.</td>', 'Awesome. It makes me a little sad at the same time. I don''t know why. Perhaps because the girl looks unhappy. I like the negative space around the girl and the doll. Added to favorites.', '2006-06-06 19:11:38.000000', NULL, 1),
