(2491449, 342312, 34659, '<td valign="top">I really like this...  For some reason, I immediately thought of JP (alfresco) when I saw this image.  Please take it as a compliment.  VERY creative.  Well done.</td>', 'I really like this...  For some reason, I immediately thought of JP (alfresco) when I saw this image.  Please take it as a compliment.  VERY creative.  Well done.', '2006-06-06 20:21:51.000000', NULL, 1),
