(2491464, 342320, 34659, '<td valign="top">Elvi?  Very cool image - love the processing and the focus impressed upon the viewer.  I''ll be interested to read how this was achieved.  Interesting shot on a number of levels.  Well done.</td>', 'Elvi?  Very cool image - love the processing and the focus impressed upon the viewer.  I''ll be interested to read how this was achieved.  Interesting shot on a number of levels.  Well done.', '2006-06-06 20:25:25.000000', NULL, 1),
