(2491967, 341886, 59343, '<td valign="top">I like how the light highlights the dress in the photo--great photo.  Nice colors and texture/tones also.  It contains nice emotion in the message of the photo as well...you can just imagine the wife/girlfriend, etc having left and leaving the dress behind.</td>', 'I like how the light highlights the dress in the photo--great photo.  Nice colors and texture/tones also.  It contains nice emotion in the message of the photo as well...you can just imagine the wife/girlfriend, etc having left and leaving the dress behind.', '2006-06-06 23:03:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2491979, 341325, 58683, '<td valign="top">Love this photo. The pose in particular really appeals to me. Damn that scarf! :-) If there is anything wrong technically with this I just don''t care. 10</td>', 'Love this photo. The pose in particular really appeals to me. Damn that scarf! :-) If there is anything wrong technically with this I just don''t care. 10', '2006-06-06 23:10:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2491980, 343212, 58683, '<td valign="top">Very cute. Trying to decide whether more detail on the floor or walls would help here but I think you got it just right.</td>', 'Very cute. Trying to decide whether more detail on the floor or walls would help here but I think you got it just right.', '2006-06-06 23:10:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2492010, 341766, 58683, '<td valign="top">The image is a little small and looks out of focus. You might have done something with the actual sparkling wine. Popped the cork and caught the ''bubbling over'' effect, added a glass (yes, I know, one ''thing'' but still), just to add some extra interest. But a nice idea.</td>', 'The image is a little small and looks out of focus. You might have done something with the actual sparkling wine. Popped the cork and caught the ''bubbling over'' effect, added a glass (yes, I know, one ''thing'' but still), just to add some extra interest. But a nice idea.', '2006-06-06 23:20:51.000000', NULL, 1),
