(2493204, 341723, 59343, '<td valign="top">Although this meets the challenge there really isn''t any quality about it that makes it stand out from the others.  It''s a clear shot with nice focus, but just seems to be lacking.</td>', 'Although this meets the challenge there really isn''t any quality about it that makes it stand out from the others.  It''s a clear shot with nice focus, but just seems to be lacking.', '2006-06-07 03:59:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2493206, 342798, 19831, '<td valign="top">Wow, this is a really cool shot. What a great, creative idea. To me, that looks like maybe a self storage unit? Works good :-) Looks like it naturally creates a really interesting lighting effect. This is just a really engaging image. The placement of the subject is great. You''ve really made the centered comp work well here. In some way, the model works in this room, yet it still has this way surreal out of place feeling. Hehe, and I gotta know, what did you have to bribe ''em with to pose for you? :-) Actually, it looks like it was a real fun shoot. I really like this, great job!</td>', 'Wow, this is a really cool shot. What a great, creative idea. To me, that looks like maybe a self storage unit? Works good :-) Looks like it naturally creates a really interesting lighting effect. This is just a really engaging image. The placement of the subject is great. You''ve really made the centered comp work well here. In some way, the model works in this room, yet it still has this way surreal out of place feeling. Hehe, and I gotta know, what did you have to bribe ''em with to pose for you? :-) Actually, it looks like it was a real fun shoot. I really like this, great job!', '2006-06-07 04:01:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2493226, 341064, 16004, '<td valign="top">this has a lot of promise; one wonders how it might have looked if you had taken one or two lightbulbs out from the background.  i think the brightness and shock value of the blue ball might have had greater impact.  i like how you positioned the ball, and the idea of space is pleasing. overall the shot seems a tad too bright to me, but very likeable.  8.  by the way; if this is your basement, i''m very jealous - seems like a wonderful place for shooting.</td>', 'this has a lot of promise; one wonders how it might have looked if you had taken one or two lightbulbs out from the background.  i think the brightness and shock value of the blue ball might have had greater impact.  i like how you positioned the ball, and the idea of space is pleasing. overall the shot seems a tad too bright to me, but very likeable.  8.  by the way; if this is your basement, i''m very jealous - seems like a wonderful place for shooting.', '2006-06-07 04:08:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2493238, 341723, 19831, '<td valign="top">Although the centered composition can be used effectively at times, I don''t think it''s working in this case. It looks like you had a lot of space to work with, maybe using the rule of thirds, or an off centered approach would make for a stronger composition here. Some nice natural lighting from the window. With all that space, and the baseboards and corners and such, it just looks like there is more potential here to use some nice leading lines and such. Try exploring different angles and points of view. This appears to be shot from the dreaded ''normal eye level'' position. Try from down low, up high, etc.</td>', 'Although the centered composition can be used effectively at times, I don''t think it''s working in this case. It looks like you had a lot of space to work with, maybe using the rule of thirds, or an off centered approach would make for a stronger composition here. Some nice natural lighting from the window. With all that space, and the baseboards and corners and such, it just looks like there is more potential here to use some nice leading lines and such. Try exploring different angles and points of view. This appears to be shot from the dreaded ''normal eye level'' position. Try from down low, up high, etc.', '2006-06-07 04:15:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2493241, 341832, 19831, '<td valign="top">Cool shot. Love your title! Sounds like it could be a movie or something :-)</td>', 'Cool shot. Love your title! Sounds like it could be a movie or something :-)', '2006-06-07 04:20:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2493308, 343029, 36616, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective - could have been totally b&amp;w. Could have used colour more creatively possibly.</td>', 'Nice perspective - could have been totally b&w. Could have used colour more creatively possibly.', '2006-06-07 05:18:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2493317, 342519, 36616, '<td valign="top">Lighting is perhaps a shade strong, lovely idea and excellent angle especially the rectangle of light on the floor. Consider changing the position of the model within the frame to a slightly stronger place.</td>', 'Lighting is perhaps a shade strong, lovely idea and excellent angle especially the rectangle of light on the floor. Consider changing the position of the model within the frame to a slightly stronger place.', '2006-06-07 05:21:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2493326, 342679, 36616, '<td valign="top">Dunces are supposed to be in a corner aren''t they? :-)<br/>Good use of colour - lighting perhaps a shade strong</td>', 'Dunces are supposed to be in a corner aren''t they? :-)Good use of colour - lighting perhaps a shade strong', '2006-06-07 05:24:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2493329, 343239, 36616, '<td valign="top">I like this concept very much. well done.</td>', 'I like this concept very much. well done.', '2006-06-07 05:25:21.000000', NULL, 1),
