(2494739, 342051, 40370, '<td valign="top">The previous random image was Superman, but this is lovely as well. Well chosen perspective and placement of the feather.</td>', 'The previous random image was Superman, but this is lovely as well. Well chosen perspective and placement of the feather.', '2006-06-07 13:25:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2494774, 342888, 40370, '<td valign="top">Wow, there''s a lot going on here, especially considering it is an empty room. First the warm colors and lines of the wood floor, trim, and heater are the best. The problem for me is the intrusion of the outdoors, adding colors outside the wonderful warm range. Lastly I would have tried the shot with the vase of lavender in the middle of the left window pane; currently it needlessly breaks up the line of the window frame. For a simple image I sure found a lot to say, good luck.</td>', 'Wow, there''s a lot going on here, especially considering it is an empty room. First the warm colors and lines of the wood floor, trim, and heater are the best. The problem for me is the intrusion of the outdoors, adding colors outside the wonderful warm range. Lastly I would have tried the shot with the vase of lavender in the middle of the left window pane; currently it needlessly breaks up the line of the window frame. For a simple image I sure found a lot to say, good luck.', '2006-06-07 13:37:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2494779, 343254, 40370, '<td valign="top">Very nice choice of DOF, but I don''t get why you left the debris-like distractions - the whitish string thing and carpet fuzzy ??</td>', 'Very nice choice of DOF, but I don''t get why you left the debris-like distractions - the whitish string thing and carpet fuzzy ??', '2006-06-07 13:41:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2494800, 343243, 40370, '<td valign="top">Not seeing the empty room, just a wrinkly pink sheet with a cute model. I must say the first thing my eye focused on was the necklace hanging down, if you want to shoot nice portraits little details like that have to be considered, I think the viewer''s eye should be drawn to their eyes and face first.</td>', 'Not seeing the empty room, just a wrinkly pink sheet with a cute model. I must say the first thing my eye focused on was the necklace hanging down, if you want to shoot nice portraits little details like that have to be considered, I think the viewer''s eye should be drawn to their eyes and face first.', '2006-06-07 13:46:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2494808, 341064, 40370, '<td valign="top">Great location for this challenge, I like that you can even see the slight curve of the stairs at the top, only complaint is that the ball doesn''t appear perfectly round like it should. Wide angle?</td>', 'Great location for this challenge, I like that you can even see the slight curve of the stairs at the top, only complaint is that the ball doesn''t appear perfectly round like it should. Wide angle?', '2006-06-07 13:48:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2494817, 341876, 40370, '<td valign="top">A little dark, the luggage is almost lost in the wall. The duotone definitely works here but I feel if it was brightened up bit more of the wonderful detail could be seen. Nice choice for the challenge.</td>', 'A little dark, the luggage is almost lost in the wall. The duotone definitely works here but I feel if it was brightened up bit more of the wonderful detail could be seen. Nice choice for the challenge.', '2006-06-07 13:51:42.000000', NULL, 1),
