(2498163, 343248, 53572, '<td valign="top">a well exposed image, but it just feels... empty.  yeah, i know the challenge is empty room, but others feel filled with emptiness, while this one is just ...empty.  i''m sorry, this makes no sense, does it?<br/> <br/>i think this might have benefitted from a wider angel to have more room init, or a landscpe format, to emphasise the emptiness.  i think that the expanse of wall is rather heavy on hte pedestal.</td>', 'a well exposed image, but it just feels... empty.  yeah, i know the challenge is empty room, but others feel filled with emptiness, while this one is just ...empty.  i''m sorry, this makes no sense, does it? i think this might have benefitted from a wider angel to have more room init, or a landscpe format, to emphasise the emptiness.  i think that the expanse of wall is rather heavy on hte pedestal.', '2006-06-08 09:29:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2498173, 343210, 53572, '<td valign="top">a nice shot, but the background and exposure rather bring it down.  i wish there was a little more light and brightness on her face and arms, less yellow relection from the floor.  the background is quite distracting, and would benfit from boing blurred.  either shooting with a wider aperture, or using post processing to blur it.  there''s a good tutorial on blurring backgrounds in the learning section of dpc.<br/> <br/>good work, and keep shooting!</td>', 'a nice shot, but the background and exposure rather bring it down.  i wish there was a little more light and brightness on her face and arms, less yellow relection from the floor.  the background is quite distracting, and would benfit from boing blurred.  either shooting with a wider aperture, or using post processing to blur it.  there''s a good tutorial on blurring backgrounds in the learning section of dpc. good work, and keep shooting!', '2006-06-08 09:31:52.000000', NULL, 1),
