(2499169, 340189, 42984, '<td valign="top">This has really good halftones.  I''m not a fan  of gratuitous B$W so for me to like the mono treatment means you''ve chosen well and done the right thing.  Borders are a win/lose thing on DPC and this time I think it''s a lose</td>', 'This has really good halftones.  I''m not a fan  of gratuitous B$W so for me to like the mono treatment means you''ve chosen well and done the right thing.  Borders are a win/lose thing on DPC and this time I think it''s a lose', '2006-06-08 16:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2499177, 343252, 22970, '<td valign="top">I think you did a good job of showing an empty room but the picture is just ok however it does meet the challenge. There is nothing to make me say wow. You did a good job of obviously letting us see your one prop in the room. But it is a shark contrast to it''s surroundings. The green is a bit to bright and blown to the point that the blue lines are hardly visible.<br/> <br/>I like the Dof but the composition could of been a little better IMO. The corner of the room is to close to the middle of the picture and the layout of your prop is not random as it would be if someone would of pulled it off and dropped it to the floor. It looks to staged.<br/> <br/>I would of liked to have seen the corner of the room a little more to the right of the picture (about on the third line) and the swim top off to the left in a random drop making it appear to be dropped to the floor instead of placed.<br/> <br/>I''m trying to tie the title into the picture and the prop. I can see where the room and the title corresponds but the prop is a little of a stretch for me. But in fairness I don''t know what your reason was for that particular prop, maybe abandoning a top as well and going topless. So it''s not a bad title or prop.<br/> <br/>As I was typing this I alternate shot came to mind. I think it would of taken this shot to a new level if you would of chosen a yellow poke dot bikini and had it on a rack hanging on the wall on the left side by the wall plate where the light is. Then it would of given me (the viewer) a sense of abandon room and the abandoned idea of someone being able to fit wear the bikini.<br/> <br/>Overall your picture is not bad. I has good lighting, focus, and DOF. Composition could of been better. Good job maybe worth a second take.<br/>Keep up the good work. 5<br/>SDW</td>', 'I think you did a good job of showing an empty room but the picture is just ok however it does meet the challenge. There is nothing to make me say wow. You did a good job of obviously letting us see your one prop in the room. But it is a shark contrast to it''s surroundings. The green is a bit to bright and blown to the point that the blue lines are hardly visible. I like the Dof but the composition could of been a little better IMO. The corner of the room is to close to the middle of the picture and the layout of your prop is not random as it would be if someone would of pulled it off and dropped it to the floor. It looks to staged. I would of liked to have seen the corner of the room a little more to the right of the picture (about on the third line) and the swim top off to the left in a random drop making it appear to be dropped to the floor instead of placed. I''m trying to tie the title into the picture and the prop. I can see where the room and the title corresponds but the prop is a little of a stretch for me. But in fairness I don''t know what your reason was for that particular prop, maybe abandoning a top as well and going topless. So it''s not a bad title or prop. As I was typing this I alternate shot came to mind. I think it would of taken this shot to a new level if you would of chosen a yellow poke dot bikini and had it on a rack hanging on the wall on the left side by the wall plate where the light is. Then it would of given me (the viewer) a sense of abandon room and the abandoned idea of someone being able to fit wear the bikini. Overall your picture is not bad. I has good lighting, focus, and DOF. Composition could of been better. Good job maybe worth a second take.Keep up the good work. 5SDW', '2006-06-08 16:16:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2499180, 340206, 42984, '<td valign="top">More about the window than a room.  We have no way of knowing if your room is empty, it looks fairly furnished from here.  You also should be aware that pictures of the cat/dog/kid if not done for a specific effect score badly on DPC because they''re seen to be "snapshots"</td>', 'More about the window than a room.  We have no way of knowing if your room is empty, it looks fairly furnished from here.  You also should be aware that pictures of the cat/dog/kid if not done for a specific effect score badly on DPC because they''re seen to be "snapshots"', '2006-06-08 16:16:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2499184, 341700, 42984, '<td valign="top">And where''s the empty room?  It''s an emty lifeguard station</td>', 'And where''s the empty room?  It''s an emty lifeguard station', '2006-06-08 16:17:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2499187, 341694, 42984, '<td valign="top">Good composition, this has a good feel about it</td>', 'Good composition, this has a good feel about it', '2006-06-08 16:18:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2499196, 342075, 42984, '<td valign="top">I like thee imagery here but I''m not sure about the lack of light in the back of the room.  On studyingit, I can''t make up my mind.  Such is the subtlety of your light that all the features in the background can be seen whislt the hard light is on the chair</td>', 'I like thee imagery here but I''m not sure about the lack of light in the back of the room.  On studyingit, I can''t make up my mind.  Such is the subtlety of your light that all the features in the background can be seen whislt the hard light is on the chair', '2006-06-08 16:20:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2499423, 343255, 45003, '<td valign="top">Great idea and well executed. I like the surreal look of it.</td>', 'Great idea and well executed. I like the surreal look of it.', '2006-06-08 17:24:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2499431, 340911, 45003, '<td valign="top">What I like most of this photo is the contrast between the bright and colorful umbrella and the wood on the walls and on the floor. Beautiful lighting too. Well done.</td>', 'What I like most of this photo is the contrast between the bright and colorful umbrella and the wood on the walls and on the floor. Beautiful lighting too. Well done.', '2006-06-08 17:26:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2499450, 342632, 45003, '<td valign="top">Nice colors. I think you could improve this one if you crop it on the right side so that you''ve only got two walls and one window left. I hope you understand what I mean, it''s a bit hard to explain what I mean in English.</td>', 'Nice colors. I think you could improve this one if you crop it on the right side so that you''ve only got two walls and one window left. I hope you understand what I mean, it''s a bit hard to explain what I mean in English.', '2006-06-08 17:34:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2499465, 342947, 45003, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately the image is a bit too small to draw attention to the glass on the stairs. Wonderful building by the way, I love the soft lighting.</td>', 'Unfortunately the image is a bit too small to draw attention to the glass on the stairs. Wonderful building by the way, I love the soft lighting.', '2006-06-08 17:37:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2499697, 341766, 27605, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the new home :o)  The picture suffers however, primarily from a lack of sharp focus, and also for being smaller than necessary.</td>', 'Congrats on the new home :o)  The picture suffers however, primarily from a lack of sharp focus, and also for being smaller than necessary.', '2006-06-08 19:03:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2499774, 343243, 43434, '<td valign="top">the image and concept is good, but the focus is a little soft.  She is a lovely model btw ... but I think that if you look again the shadow below her breast is a bit unflattering .... and only emphasises soze ... if you know what I mean. :)</td>', 'the image and concept is good, but the focus is a little soft.  She is a lovely model btw ... but I think that if you look again the shadow below her breast is a bit unflattering .... and only emphasises soze ... if you know what I mean. :)', '2006-06-08 19:30:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2499877, 342798, 55838, '<td valign="top">Back to bump you up.  Now here''s something you don''t see everyday..  :)  This shot has a cool look - great lines and I love the blue tone.  Very creative.  9</td>', 'Back to bump you up.  Now here''s something you don''t see everyday..  :)  This shot has a cool look - great lines and I love the blue tone.  Very creative.  9', '2006-06-08 20:04:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2499884, 343212, 55838, '<td valign="top">Back to bump you up.  One of my favorites and a clear ribbon winner in my opinion.  Good choice on the light, color, and composition.  Very well done.</td>', 'Back to bump you up.  One of my favorites and a clear ribbon winner in my opinion.  Good choice on the light, color, and composition.  Very well done.', '2006-06-08 20:06:32.000000', NULL, 1),
