(2500230, 343234, 32198, '<td valign="top">Lighting made this a lower score than it could have been. Using light to isolate the pedestal from the wall and floor would have made this more dramatic.</td>', 'Lighting made this a lower score than it could have been. Using light to isolate the pedestal from the wall and floor would have made this more dramatic.', '2006-06-08 22:06:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2500362, 340086, 17203, '<td valign="top">Now THAT''S what I call a walk-in closet! ;-)<br/> <br/>Good exposure, and an excellent sense of scale. Well done!</td>', 'Now THAT''S what I call a walk-in closet! ;-) Good exposure, and an excellent sense of scale. Well done!', '2006-06-08 23:01:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2500398, 342798, 17203, '<td valign="top">What a wonderfully wacky idea! Good tonality and composition, and the muted colors fit the image well. Excellent! 10</td>', 'What a wonderfully wacky idea! Good tonality and composition, and the muted colors fit the image well. Excellent! 10', '2006-06-08 23:08:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2500414, 343212, 17203, '<td valign="top">One of the rare photos in this challenge that combines a sense of the empty room with good composition and an actual REASON for something to be there. Bonus points for not stating the obvious in the title and letting the viewer imagine the story. I prefer a bit more shadow detail, and a wider angle would help, but still one of the best this week. 9</td>', 'One of the rare photos in this challenge that combines a sense of the empty room with good composition and an actual REASON for something to be there. Bonus points for not stating the obvious in the title and letting the viewer imagine the story. I prefer a bit more shadow detail, and a wider angle would help, but still one of the best this week. 9', '2006-06-08 23:12:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2500424, 341886, 17203, '<td valign="top">Love the splash of color and the clear visual storytelling. I would have flipped the image horizontally to put the red "finale" at the end, but one of my top picks nonetheless. 9</td>', 'Love the splash of color and the clear visual storytelling. I would have flipped the image horizontally to put the red "finale" at the end, but one of my top picks nonetheless. 9', '2006-06-08 23:14:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2500440, 342715, 17203, '<td valign="top">A little too red, and a little too dark, but a little too wonderful to give a low vote. 9  ;-)</td>', 'A little too red, and a little too dark, but a little too wonderful to give a low vote. 9  ;-)', '2006-06-08 23:17:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2500451, 341366, 17203, '<td valign="top">Well, now we know WHY the room is empty... LOL!<br/> <br/>I wouldn''t change a thing. 10</td>', 'Well, now we know WHY the room is empty... LOL! I wouldn''t change a thing. 10', '2006-06-08 23:20:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2500507, 343248, 22970, '<td valign="top">I like the tone of your photograph and the lighting is good. Your crop of the room is to tight, IMO, not giving me the sense of an empty room. It''s like I could look to the left or right and see a sofa or chair. The Corner of the room (vertical line) is stronger to me than the subject. I find my eyes homing in on the line. <br/> <br/>I don''t know if you were able to, but I feel the statue would of been better placed in the corner covering up the most of the corner line and then doing some burn to take down the highlights on the line above the statue. And maybe a little more sharpness on the statue would of helped.<br/> <br/>With all that said I feel your photograph is good and with a few adjustments could of been better. I feel you did meet the challenge even though the crop is tight. Keep up the good work and I wish you well in the challenge. 5</td>', 'I like the tone of your photograph and the lighting is good. Your crop of the room is to tight, IMO, not giving me the sense of an empty room. It''s like I could look to the left or right and see a sofa or chair. The Corner of the room (vertical line) is stronger to me than the subject. I find my eyes homing in on the line.  I don''t know if you were able to, but I feel the statue would of been better placed in the corner covering up the most of the corner line and then doing some burn to take down the highlights on the line above the statue. And maybe a little more sharpness on the statue would of helped. With all that said I feel your photograph is good and with a few adjustments could of been better. I feel you did meet the challenge even though the crop is tight. Keep up the good work and I wish you well in the challenge. 5', '2006-06-08 23:33:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2500570, 341886, 14620, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites of the challenge.  It''s very simple, but the way it''s processed and the use of light makes it very powerful. 9 from me. :)</td>', 'One of my favorites of the challenge.  It''s very simple, but the way it''s processed and the use of light makes it very powerful. 9 from me. :)', '2006-06-08 23:47:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2500581, 341045, 14620, '<td valign="top">This is just bizarre and I love it!  Can''t really tell you why, there''s just something about it.  Bizarre.  All the textures, the vignetting, the chalk board, the colors and the uuummmmm armadillo(??) awesome, but bizarre. 8</td>', 'This is just bizarre and I love it!  Can''t really tell you why, there''s just something about it.  Bizarre.  All the textures, the vignetting, the chalk board, the colors and the uuummmmm armadillo(??) awesome, but bizarre. 8', '2006-06-08 23:51:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2500792, 341045, 7778, '<td valign="top">The colours, the asymmetry of the walls, the <br/>fact that the armadillo is made from authentic armadillo <br/>associated with opulent romance on  an old grade-one blackboard, <br/>the apparent naiveté of set-up versus a killer perspective, these <br/> <br/>are all crazy enough and presented in such contiguous taste and harmony...<br/>as to corrupt my otherwise impeccable principles and prejudices, so <br/>that I cannot help myself as I am awarding this magic a score<br/>conventionally reserved for dead photographers.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-06-12 11:02:19.</i></td>', 'The colours, the asymmetry of the walls, the fact that the armadillo is made from authentic armadillo associated with opulent romance on  an old grade-one blackboard, the apparent naiveté of set-up versus a killer perspective, these  are all crazy enough and presented in such contiguous taste and harmony...as to corrupt my otherwise impeccable principles and prejudices, so that I cannot help myself as I am awarding this magic a scoreconventionally reserved for dead photographers.', '2006-06-09 01:06:26.000000', '2006-06-12 12:02:19.000000', 1),
(2500803, 340911, 7778, '<td valign="top">The contrast is so surreal, the umbrella appears to levitate <br/>like a papier-mache circus wheel in the sixteenth chapel.<br/> <br/>There is, in my view, no better entry in this challenge.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-06-12 11:04:25.</i></td>', 'The contrast is so surreal, the umbrella appears to levitate like a papier-mache circus wheel in the sixteenth chapel. There is, in my view, no better entry in this challenge.', '2006-06-09 01:13:36.000000', '2006-06-12 12:04:25.000000', 1),
(2500819, 340212, 60298, '<td valign="top">Gives me that same eerie feeling that was presented in THX1138.<br/> <br/>Well done!</td>', 'Gives me that same eerie feeling that was presented in THX1138. Well done!', '2006-06-09 01:23:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2500823, 342651, 60298, '<td valign="top">Nicely conceived.  I never quite thought of it in those terms.<br/> <br/>I really enjoyed this one.</td>', 'Nicely conceived.  I never quite thought of it in those terms. I really enjoyed this one.', '2006-06-09 01:26:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2500848, 343241, 48058, '<td valign="top">I can see what you were trying to do (I think) but the distortion in the lines throws it off for me a bit.</td>', 'I can see what you were trying to do (I think) but the distortion in the lines throws it off for me a bit.', '2006-06-09 01:39:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2500851, 343246, 48058, '<td valign="top">This picture is a bit more interesting than some of the others. You have a neat  group of colors and patterns. It does look like it''s outside rather than inside though... but still a bit better than some in this challenge.</td>', 'This picture is a bit more interesting than some of the others. You have a neat  group of colors and patterns. It does look like it''s outside rather than inside though... but still a bit better than some in this challenge.', '2006-06-09 01:42:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2500862, 341886, 48058, '<td valign="top">I think this is a very good use of light, shadows and lines. I think it was very well thought out. Nice job.</td>', 'I think this is a very good use of light, shadows and lines. I think it was very well thought out. Nice job.', '2006-06-09 01:46:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2500865, 342312, 48058, '<td valign="top">I like how you used the rope to lead the eye down and then how the lines lead your eyes around and around. I really like this picture.</td>', 'I like how you used the rope to lead the eye down and then how the lines lead your eyes around and around. I really like this picture.', '2006-06-09 01:47:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2500869, 342600, 48058, '<td valign="top">This image would have had a lot more impact had  you been able to take out the heating register along the wall. But a cute picture anyway.</td>', 'This image would have had a lot more impact had  you been able to take out the heating register along the wall. But a cute picture anyway.', '2006-06-09 01:49:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2500872, 343212, 48058, '<td valign="top">I like how the floor lines and the lines of the moulding all lead the eyes to the girl in the corner. Even when I first looked at it and got the impression of her having to stand in the corner for being bad, I still had to smile at it. Then I saw your title and realized she was counting, which made it better.  The only nit is I think you cropped it to close to her head. I think a little more room would have been better. Still an excellent job.</td>', 'I like how the floor lines and the lines of the moulding all lead the eyes to the girl in the corner. Even when I first looked at it and got the impression of her having to stand in the corner for being bad, I still had to smile at it. Then I saw your title and realized she was counting, which made it better.  The only nit is I think you cropped it to close to her head. I think a little more room would have been better. Still an excellent job.', '2006-06-09 01:50:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2500879, 343238, 19831, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. Very cool point of view, and a good sound composition.</td>', 'Nice shot. Very cool point of view, and a good sound composition.', '2006-06-09 01:55:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2501059, 340590, 10268, '<td valign="top">A little too centered for me, but I love the processing you did with this.  Looks awesome.  7</td>', 'A little too centered for me, but I love the processing you did with this.  Looks awesome.  7', '2006-06-09 04:42:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2501062, 341325, 33352, '<td valign="top">The blue appearing in the processing a bit off puting. back for a second bumping..Forget the processing win the race...</td>', 'The blue appearing in the processing a bit off puting. back for a second bumping..Forget the processing win the race...', '2006-06-09 04:44:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2501063, 341366, 10268, '<td valign="top">8.  10 if it would have been alone on a plane!  <br/> <br/>Love the selective desaturation by the way.</td>', '8.  10 if it would have been alone on a plane!   Love the selective desaturation by the way.', '2006-06-09 04:46:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2501086, 342947, 23478, '<td valign="top">Excellent, good lighting, unique setting, just the image is small.</td>', 'Excellent, good lighting, unique setting, just the image is small.', '2006-06-09 05:31:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2501089, 340189, 23478, '<td valign="top">Interesting... the big shadow is a bit of a distraction.</td>', 'Interesting... the big shadow is a bit of a distraction.', '2006-06-09 05:32:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2501092, 342382, 23478, '<td valign="top">This seems to have alot of potential, but there just seems to be a lack of impact in the image.</td>', 'This seems to have alot of potential, but there just seems to be a lack of impact in the image.', '2006-06-09 05:34:47.000000', NULL, 1);
