(2502395, 343218, 30049, '<td valign="top">Not sure how you could''ve done anything differently, but the view outside the window is distracting.  I like your choice of color for the border.  Wow. That''s the second border I''ve commented on in this challenge.  I guess if I''m going to notice the border (the black ones are usually a given) it should be for a good reason as it is in your case.  ;^)<br/> <br/>The exposure for this arrangement looks tricky to not underexpose the room, nor overexpose the window sunlight on the wall.  Looks fine from here.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Not sure how you could''ve done anything differently, but the view outside the window is distracting.  I like your choice of color for the border.  Wow. That''s the second border I''ve commented on in this challenge.  I guess if I''m going to notice the border (the black ones are usually a given) it should be for a good reason as it is in your case.  ;^) The exposure for this arrangement looks tricky to not underexpose the room, nor overexpose the window sunlight on the wall.  Looks fine from here.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-06-09 15:09:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2502409, 341683, 30049, '<td valign="top">Well, the beachball is positioned correctly, and it''s not a chair.  ;^)  As for the room it doesn''t feel much like a room.  Seems more industrial (which it is) or like a parking garage with windows.  Not sure why I''m mentioning the room type.  Maybe because the size of the room makes this image feel less personal.  The child''s toy in this kind of space seems a bit disconnected.  Sorry if my ramblings aren''t helpful...I''m just shooting from the hip as the thoughts come in on your entry for this challenge.  Good luck.</td>', 'Well, the beachball is positioned correctly, and it''s not a chair.  ;^)  As for the room it doesn''t feel much like a room.  Seems more industrial (which it is) or like a parking garage with windows.  Not sure why I''m mentioning the room type.  Maybe because the size of the room makes this image feel less personal.  The child''s toy in this kind of space seems a bit disconnected.  Sorry if my ramblings aren''t helpful...I''m just shooting from the hip as the thoughts come in on your entry for this challenge.  Good luck.', '2006-06-09 15:16:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2502416, 342051, 30049, '<td valign="top">This looks like a parking garage, although it''s most likely an old industrial building.  Interesting concept with the feather.  Would work better in a smaller space...doesn''t feel much like a "room".  Having a hard time explaining what I mean - sorry.  Guess it''s too much space to get a personal connection with the subject for this challenge.</td>', 'This looks like a parking garage, although it''s most likely an old industrial building.  Interesting concept with the feather.  Would work better in a smaller space...doesn''t feel much like a "room".  Having a hard time explaining what I mean - sorry.  Guess it''s too much space to get a personal connection with the subject for this challenge.', '2006-06-09 15:22:16.000000', NULL, 1),
