(2502925, 342903, 30049, '<td valign="top">I''m sure you''re getting a lot of "views" on this - going after the sex appeal crowd will certainly get it loaded in the browser.  Not sure why this image is in this challenge - I guess the lady is your one "item" to add to an empty room?  Speaking of empty rooms, I''m not seeing enough empty room to know that it is a room.  Looks more like a corner of the room.  I''m not voting on this, but I can''t imagine giving it more than an average score based on the above comments.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'I''m sure you''re getting a lot of "views" on this - going after the sex appeal crowd will certainly get it loaded in the browser.  Not sure why this image is in this challenge - I guess the lady is your one "item" to add to an empty room?  Speaking of empty rooms, I''m not seeing enough empty room to know that it is a room.  Looks more like a corner of the room.  I''m not voting on this, but I can''t imagine giving it more than an average score based on the above comments.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.', '2006-06-09 18:50:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2502928, 341325, 30049, '<td valign="top">Nothing like "sex sells", eh?  I''m not voting, but good luck.  Personally, I wouldn''t score this much more than average because the image is going for sex appeal more than photograpic quality.  JMO of course.  ;^)</td>', 'Nothing like "sex sells", eh?  I''m not voting, but good luck.  Personally, I wouldn''t score this much more than average because the image is going for sex appeal more than photograpic quality.  JMO of course.  ;^)', '2006-06-09 18:52:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2502954, 341325, 29269, '<td valign="top">I''m sure you are aware of how beautiful your body is, and how to use it to full photographical effect. I only wish that you''ve composed it so that there wasn''t that streak of light through your crotch. I had mixed feelings about it, and finally decided against it. Yes, this way it reveals just a little bit more than without it, but I would have liked it the same even with just a hint of the shape.<br/> <br/>Technically, the whole image has a dreamy look to it, the aura around you and the scarf brings out the emotions. Scarf matches the hair color, which is a nice touch. The light in the window is a tad too bright, but since any shorter exposure would have lost all the details of the floor, this is probably the best you could do given the circumstances.<br/> <br/>Good luck with the score! (with a bump to 9)<br/> <br/>-Serge</td>', 'I''m sure you are aware of how beautiful your body is, and how to use it to full photographical effect. I only wish that you''ve composed it so that there wasn''t that streak of light through your crotch. I had mixed feelings about it, and finally decided against it. Yes, this way it reveals just a little bit more than without it, but I would have liked it the same even with just a hint of the shape. Technically, the whole image has a dreamy look to it, the aura around you and the scarf brings out the emotions. Scarf matches the hair color, which is a nice touch. The light in the window is a tad too bright, but since any shorter exposure would have lost all the details of the floor, this is probably the best you could do given the circumstances. Good luck with the score! (with a bump to 9) -Serge', '2006-06-09 19:04:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2503050, 343160, 30982, '<td valign="top">Clever idea, well executed.  Like the lighting used and how the mower nearly blends into the floor at the brightest point.</td>', 'Clever idea, well executed.  Like the lighting used and how the mower nearly blends into the floor at the brightest point.', '2006-06-09 20:00:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2503086, 343241, 37730, '<td valign="top">nice idea and photo</td>', 'nice idea and photo', '2006-06-09 20:21:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2503125, 343243, 54731, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t look like an empty room at all. <br/> <br/>Edit: Bumping up because I like the postprocessing and the look of this image and there not many great entries, 7</td>', 'Doesn''t look like an empty room at all.  Edit: Bumping up because I like the postprocessing and the look of this image and there not many great entries, 7', '2006-06-09 20:36:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2503131, 341886, 60333, '<td valign="top">Great contrast and use of natural lighting.</td>', 'Great contrast and use of natural lighting.', '2006-06-09 20:38:59.000000', NULL, 1);
