(2503679, 342966, 60335, '<td valign="top">It feels slightly crooked, maybe rotate .5 to the left?  I like the abandoned look though.</td>', 'It feels slightly crooked, maybe rotate .5 to the left?  I like the abandoned look though.', '2006-06-10 00:19:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2503785, 341064, 30982, '<td valign="top">That''s a very big blue ball.  Like the perspective, the lighting and the shadows.  Like the fact that the very big blue ball looks quite odd in this setting.</td>', 'That''s a very big blue ball.  Like the perspective, the lighting and the shadows.  Like the fact that the very big blue ball looks quite odd in this setting.', '2006-06-10 00:51:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2503787, 343039, 30982, '<td valign="top">Quite creative!  The room doesn''t look quite real but it''s a surreal picture of sorts so that''s OK.</td>', 'Quite creative!  The room doesn''t look quite real but it''s a surreal picture of sorts so that''s OK.', '2006-06-10 00:52:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2503790, 340590, 30982, '<td valign="top">I like the tones and textures - nice lighting.  Would maybe like the chair not quite on the center line.</td>', 'I like the tones and textures - nice lighting.  Would maybe like the chair not quite on the center line.', '2006-06-10 00:53:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2503794, 343210, 30982, '<td valign="top">Like the expression on the subjects face and the use of the sunlit patches on the floor.  The composition is a bit too centered for me - might be nice to see a bit more of the shadow.</td>', 'Like the expression on the subjects face and the use of the sunlit patches on the floor.  The composition is a bit too centered for me - might be nice to see a bit more of the shadow.', '2006-06-10 00:54:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2503801, 343234, 30982, '<td valign="top">Some very vivid colors there!  A bit harshly lit.</td>', 'Some very vivid colors there!  A bit harshly lit.', '2006-06-10 00:56:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2503802, 343037, 30982, '<td valign="top">Like the composition - this is a very nice shot of an "under construction" building - conveys a sense of emptiness and "not quite there" well.</td>', 'Like the composition - this is a very nice shot of an "under construction" building - conveys a sense of emptiness and "not quite there" well.', '2006-06-10 00:57:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2503809, 340189, 30982, '<td valign="top">This is one instance where I don''t think the single line within the picture border works - well, it works on the top and sides, but I thought it was a cord across the floor at first.  I do like the concept and hope you didn''t hang that thing just for the challenge!</td>', 'This is one instance where I don''t think the single line within the picture border works - well, it works on the top and sides, but I thought it was a cord across the floor at first.  I do like the concept and hope you didn''t hang that thing just for the challenge!', '2006-06-10 01:00:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2503810, 342970, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nice colors, lines, and shapes.  Not sure what the "one thing" in the room is, though.</td>', 'Nice colors, lines, and shapes.  Not sure what the "one thing" in the room is, though.', '2006-06-10 01:02:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2503812, 342651, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nice concept, well executed.  This is one I hope people don''t judge on the thumbnail.  Angles, lighting are nicely done for this picture.</td>', 'Nice concept, well executed.  This is one I hope people don''t judge on the thumbnail.  Angles, lighting are nicely done for this picture.', '2006-06-10 01:03:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2504160, 343239, 22970, '<td valign="top">Great job all around the photo captures my attention and retains it. Which usually would be a good thing except that "Superman blowup". :P Really I wish you would of used a prop that along with the theme of the photo and the processing. I''m not going  to knock you for having a bad prop (at least it shows you put something in the room) But I would love to see this photo retaken with the same editing with a corresponding prop. I believe it would be great. 7</td>', 'Great job all around the photo captures my attention and retains it. Which usually would be a good thing except that "Superman blowup". :P Really I wish you would of used a prop that along with the theme of the photo and the processing. I''m not going  to knock you for having a bad prop (at least it shows you put something in the room) But I would love to see this photo retaken with the same editing with a corresponding prop. I believe it would be great. 7', '2006-06-10 03:24:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2504163, 343246, 22970, '<td valign="top">Nice photograph with wonderful colors. You photo does give me a sense of emptiness. The only thing I may have done differently is bring the chair out a little. Make it stand out more. With all the colors around it, it kind of blends. Good Job! 7</td>', 'Nice photograph with wonderful colors. You photo does give me a sense of emptiness. The only thing I may have done differently is bring the chair out a little. Make it stand out more. With all the colors around it, it kind of blends. Good Job! 7', '2006-06-10 03:25:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2504198, 342213, 45003, '<td valign="top">Nice model and clothing. I like her pose too. I feel that the stuff on the background and the white things ( are it lamps or windows? ) are distracting. I would have loved it more without it.</td>', 'Nice model and clothing. I like her pose too. I feel that the stuff on the background and the white things ( are it lamps or windows? ) are distracting. I would have loved it more without it.', '2006-06-10 04:18:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2504199, 342608, 45003, '<td valign="top">Great mood in this one. I love the angle too. I''m not sure if I like the shadow on the right side. But the emotion you captured here is most important.</td>', 'Great mood in this one. I love the angle too. I''m not sure if I like the shadow on the right side. But the emotion you captured here is most important.', '2006-06-10 04:23:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2504200, 341358, 45003, '<td valign="top">Awesome. Beautiful colors and I like your idea a lot. Lovely lighting too. Well done.</td>', 'Awesome. Beautiful colors and I like your idea a lot. Lovely lighting too. Well done.', '2006-06-10 04:25:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2504201, 342017, 45003, '<td valign="top">I love this. I like it that you tilted it. Great colors. The window is a bit overexposed, it''s a little bit distracting.</td>', 'I love this. I like it that you tilted it. Great colors. The window is a bit overexposed, it''s a little bit distracting.', '2006-06-10 04:27:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2504206, 340273, 45003, '<td valign="top">You know, when I saw this challenge this was exactly what came up in my head. I didn''t participate by the way. When I think of an empty room I think of solitude. I feel that you succeeded very well in expressing this. Great mood, I really love the emotion you captured here. <br/> <br/>Gets a 10 from me. Added to favorites.</td>', 'You know, when I saw this challenge this was exactly what came up in my head. I didn''t participate by the way. When I think of an empty room I think of solitude. I feel that you succeeded very well in expressing this. Great mood, I really love the emotion you captured here.  Gets a 10 from me. Added to favorites.', '2006-06-10 04:34:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2504208, 343110, 45003, '<td valign="top">I think I know who this is, I recognize your style. But perhaps I''m wrong. We''ll see :) <br/> <br/>I like it. I love the colors and that you''ve put the guitar in the center. It immediately draws the attention.</td>', 'I think I know who this is, I recognize your style. But perhaps I''m wrong. We''ll see :)  I like it. I love the colors and that you''ve put the guitar in the center. It immediately draws the attention.', '2006-06-10 04:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2504211, 343109, 45003, '<td valign="top">Correct me if I''m wrong, but I think this is one of SJ. And otherwise you have exact the same dog and chain :P ( don''t know if that''s the right word for that thing on his neck ). <br/> <br/>Anyway, I like this one. Great room and I love the colors. I like the expression on his face. One thing I don''t like in this one is that you cut off his body. It looks kind of weird. Sometimes crops like this look good and sometimes they don''t.</td>', 'Correct me if I''m wrong, but I think this is one of SJ. And otherwise you have exact the same dog and chain :P ( don''t know if that''s the right word for that thing on his neck ).  Anyway, I like this one. Great room and I love the colors. I like the expression on his face. One thing I don''t like in this one is that you cut off his body. It looks kind of weird. Sometimes crops like this look good and sometimes they don''t.', '2006-06-10 04:45:05.000000', NULL, 1),
