rsion]And I don''t think that I''ll see her again,But we shared a moment that will last till the end. You''re beautiful. You''re beautiful.You''re beautiful, it''s true.I saw your face in a crowded place,And I don''t know what to do,''Cause I''ll never be with you. You''re beautiful. You''re beautiful.You''re beautiful, it''s true.There must be an angel with a smile on her face,When she thought up that I should be with you.But it''s time to face the truth,I will never be with you.', '2006-06-10 21:06:36.000000', NULL, 1),
