(2507498, 343110, 60165, '<td valign="top">Nice composition except I don''t like the background outside, am I being to harsh if I say the object is not <i>inside</i> the room?</td>', 'Nice composition except I don''t like the background outside, am I being to harsh if I say the object is not inside the room?', '2006-06-11 23:13:21.000000', NULL, 1),
