(2507527, 343242, 60165, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, I just wish she would have been a bit more bright in her expression, in order to comply with your title. I wonder what room that is?</td>', 'Nice composition, I just wish she would have been a bit more bright in her expression, in order to comply with your title. I wonder what room that is?', '2006-06-11 23:26:08.000000', NULL, 1),
