(2507549, 342127, 60165, '<td valign="top">Nice picture but too much light for me, although i know it is meant that way. It does fit the title of the picture, though, and challenge is met, so an eight from here ...</td>', 'Nice picture but too much light for me, although i know it is meant that way. It does fit the title of the picture, though, and challenge is met, so an eight from here ...', '2006-06-11 23:29:44.000000', NULL, 1),
