(2507893, 343243, 48717, '<td valign="top">Nice pic, good focus and color...but I do not get the sense of empty room.  Hey I have seen this...LeRoy?  What is this doing here?</td>', 'Nice pic, good focus and color...but I do not get the sense of empty room.  Hey I have seen this...LeRoy?  What is this doing here?', '2006-06-12 00:50:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2507894, 340206, 5792, '<td valign="top">Nothing wrong with a picture featuring a cat but you can be certain that many voters will question the room being empty since very little of it is included in the composition. The shadows are harsh and their blue tones are very unnatural looking. The cat himself looks very flat and dark. It is almost as if the cat is suffering from the use of out-of-gamut colors where the detail is lost and the comes out darker unrealistic colored substitution colors. Or you may have went overboard with color adjustments. That is easy to do as well.</td>', 'Nothing wrong with a picture featuring a cat but you can be certain that many voters will question the room being empty since very little of it is included in the composition. The shadows are harsh and their blue tones are very unnatural looking. The cat himself looks very flat and dark. It is almost as if the cat is suffering from the use of out-of-gamut colors where the detail is lost and the comes out darker unrealistic colored substitution colors. Or you may have went overboard with color adjustments. That is easy to do as well.', '2006-06-12 00:50:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2507895, 341755, 29011, '<td valign="top">A nice shot but think it would''ve worked better for the Framing II challenge.</td>', 'A nice shot but think it would''ve worked better for the Framing II challenge.', '2006-06-12 00:51:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2507898, 342947, 29011, '<td valign="top">It''s a very nice interior to photograph but the vase isn''t much of a part of it, being so tiny in the image.</td>', 'It''s a very nice interior to photograph but the vase isn''t much of a part of it, being so tiny in the image.', '2006-06-12 00:53:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2507903, 341766, 5792, '<td valign="top">Good concept... champagne to celebrate buying or selling a house... but the technical implementation leaves much to be desired. Almost looks like the picture sufferes from camera movement during the exposure. The shadow of the bottle is distracting. The bottle needs to be in tack sharp focus to work. An idea worth considering would have been to have the bottl open with two champaigne glass filled nearby being held by two hands each coming in from a different side.</td>', 'Good concept... champagne to celebrate buying or selling a house... but the technical implementation leaves much to be desired. Almost looks like the picture sufferes from camera movement during the exposure. The shadow of the bottle is distracting. The bottle needs to be in tack sharp focus to work. An idea worth considering would have been to have the bottl open with two champaigne glass filled nearby being held by two hands each coming in from a different side.', '2006-06-12 00:55:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2507906, 342970, 29011, '<td valign="top">Really like the lines, color and overall graphic look of the image.</td>', 'Really like the lines, color and overall graphic look of the image.', '2006-06-12 00:55:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2507908, 343182, 5792, '<td valign="top">A curious composition. Conceptually OK and the red colors and green nicely contrast the dingy grey of the room. A series of little things and technical flaws makes it difficult to score this image higher. The foreground rubble looks a bit oversharpened, The areas lighted from the outside are overexposed and overall lighting lacks balance. The perspective and overall composition lacks creativity and leaves the viewer wondering what you are trying to say with this picture.</td>', 'A curious composition. Conceptually OK and the red colors and green nicely contrast the dingy grey of the room. A series of little things and technical flaws makes it difficult to score this image higher. The foreground rubble looks a bit oversharpened, The areas lighted from the outside are overexposed and overall lighting lacks balance. The perspective and overall composition lacks creativity and leaves the viewer wondering what you are trying to say with this picture.', '2006-06-12 00:56:48.000000', NULL, 1),
