(2508801, 343037, 36006, '<td valign="top">I used to live in Nashville. I know that people can read there. Your pix had so much potential, but you forgot to do one thing, right??<br/> <br/>The midtones are ok in this b&amp;w, the windows are way overblown, the blacks are too deep. Pure blacks and whites ''must'' have texture to be convinceing. Nice lighting, nice lines, comp ok could be better.<br/> <br/>Don''t give up, try again. Next time re-read the challenge rules.<br/> <br/>Good luck.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-06-12 07:15:39.</i></td>', 'I used to live in Nashville. I know that people can read there. Your pix had so much potential, but you forgot to do one thing, right?? The midtones are ok in this b&w, the windows are way overblown, the blacks are too deep. Pure blacks and whites ''must'' have texture to be convinceing. Nice lighting, nice lines, comp ok could be better. Don''t give up, try again. Next time re-read the challenge rules. Good luck.', '2006-06-12 08:15:09.000000', '2006-06-12 08:15:39.000000', 0),
