(2613811, 343215, 37430, '<td valign="top">Wow! This is simply wonderful. The dash of scarlet makes it even more interesting. Framing and lighting is just fine. The photo is overexposed or blown out at points, but it fits the overall composition. The focus seems to be little soft though.</td>', 'Wow! This is simply wonderful. The dash of scarlet makes it even more interesting. Framing and lighting is just fine. The photo is overexposed or blown out at points, but it fits the overall composition. The focus seems to be little soft though.', '2006-07-12 06:04:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(2623883, 343205, 41337, '<td valign="top">I remember this photo being one of my favorites in the challenge. I''m sure you''re already aware of this, but in case not, your shadows areas are just fine. I can easily see the back wall.</td>', 'I remember this photo being one of my favorites in the challenge. I''m sure you''re already aware of this, but in case not, your shadows areas are just fine. I can easily see the back wall.', '2006-07-15 00:12:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(2623993, 342715, 60862, '<td valign="top">This shot and the title complement each other beautifully.<br/> <br/>After thinking about it a bit, I decided I really like all the space at the top - it gives you the viewpoint of an adult looking down at the doll.<br/> <br/>I''d love to see it lightened some, though, as others have suggested.  It''s just a little too hard to see the doll.<br/> <br/>And congrats on your finish!</td>', 'This shot and the title complement each other beautifully. After thinking about it a bit, I decided I really like all the space at the top - it gives you the viewpoint of an adult looking down at the doll. I''d love to see it lightened some, though, as others have suggested.  It''s just a little too hard to see the doll. And congrats on your finish!', '2006-07-15 01:06:54.000000', NULL, 0),
